Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:03:05.20,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单第三轮
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:03:05.20,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}郑钦文 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}³ {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 凯斯 · 赛后新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.64,0:00:01.52,EN,,0,0,0,,tough one today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.64,0:00:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天这场不好打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:02.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Can you just take us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:02.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,能不能带我们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:03.36,EN,,0,0,0,,through your perspective?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,从你的角度回顾一下？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,What was what was going on maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,第三盘那会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:06.56,EN,,0,0,0,,in your mind in the third set?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:06.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你脑子里在想什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:07.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:07.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:09.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I feel like I obviously got off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我开局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:17.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to a really good lead and then I just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿到了很大的领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:22.96,EN,,0,0,0,,got really I mean got really scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.12,0:00:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后我就变得非常害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.96,EN,,0,0,0,,but like I couldn't swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是挥不开拍了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:29.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Tennis just feels really hard right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:29.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球现在感觉真的很难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:33.52,EN,,0,0,0,,So feel like that kind of took over,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:33.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉那种情绪占了上风
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:35.12,EN,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.80,EN,,0,0,0,,She said when it was five love,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,她说 5-0 的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.32,EN,,0,0,0,,she didn't feel like she was playing that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,她不觉得自己打得有多差
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:40.40,EN,,0,0,0,,She thought you were playing that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:40.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,她觉得是你打得太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:43.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Did you feel like your level dropped at all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得是你的水平掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.76,0:00:47.12,EN,,0,0,0,,or hers really came up that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.76,0:00:47.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是她真的提升了那么多？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:50.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean I think my level dropped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得是我的水平掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:52.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and she started to play better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:52.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后她开始打得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:54.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:55.52,EN,,0,0,0,,David,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:55.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:56.40,EN,,0,0,0,,how are you feeling coming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:56.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,来打这站的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:00:56.96,EN,,0,0,0,,into the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:00:56.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的感觉是怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:58.88,EN,,0,0,0,,when you say tennis was is hard right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你说网球现在很难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:01:00.00,EN,,0,0,0,,has this been how you've been feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:01:00.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,这种感觉是持续了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:03.04,EN,,0,0,0,,for a few months, a few weeks or just
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:03.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,几个月 几周 还是……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean I just feel like I've kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 我觉得我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:10.64,EN,,0,0,0,,of been struggling for a while now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经挣扎了有一阵子了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:14.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and I feel like I've was able to kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:14.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得之前还能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:16.96,EN,,0,0,0,,of play through it for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,硬撑着打过去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:19.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sure everyone could kind of see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:19.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我相信大家都看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:20.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that I was struggling a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我有点挣扎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:26.00,EN,,0,0,0,,but inside it's felt probably even bigger
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:26.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,但在心里 这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:26.64,EN,,0,0,0,,than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:26.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,可能比看上去还要大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.64,0:01:31.84,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, it just some weeks are easier
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.64,0:01:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,有些星期会好过一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:35.20,EN,,0,0,0,,than others and this week is obviously one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这一周显然是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:37.04,EN,,0,0,0,,of the harder ones just cuz you care
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:37.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,比较难熬的那一周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你太在乎了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:42.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:48.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to have to make some sort of changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得做出一些改变
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.88,0:01:49.28,EN,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.88,0:01:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:50.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I I got in late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我来晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:51.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.84,0:01:53.04,EN,,0,0,0,,But Madison,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.84,0:01:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,麦迪逊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:55.92,EN,,0,0,0,,what were the specifics do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得具体是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.92,0:02:00.28,EN,,0,0,0,,of what turned the match around?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.92,0:02:00.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,让这场球翻了过来？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.76,0:02:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Like at the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.76,0:02:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I think she started playing better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得她开始打得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:14.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I started playing poorly and then I felt like I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:14.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我开始打得很差
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:15.68,EN,,0,0,0,,couldn't play tennis anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后感觉自己不会打网球了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:23.12,EN,,0,0,0,,And it just was it just felt like it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,那一下感觉这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:24.64,EN,,0,0,0,,was a much bigger deal than just playing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:24.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,突然远远不止是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:27.92,EN,,0,0,0,,a tennis match all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:27.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,打一场网球比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.92,0:02:29.68,EN,,0,0,0,,We'll take one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.92,0:02:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:31.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Madison, I appreciate this is straight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:31.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,麦迪逊 我知道这是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:33.84,EN,,0,0,0,,after the match and you said you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,刚打完就问 你刚说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.84,0:02:35.20,EN,,0,0,0,,might want to make some changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.84,0:02:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,可能要做一些改变
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:36.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I wonder are there changes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,是不是有一些改变
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:38.32,EN,,0,0,0,,that you've been thinking about making
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:38.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,你已经考虑了一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:40.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and this maybe just pushes you towards
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这场球只是把你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:42.08,EN,,0,0,0,,them or is that more of a broad statement
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,往那儿推了一把 还是说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:43.20,EN,,0,0,0,,when you just think you don't want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是一个笼统的说法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:44.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to feel like this anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是不想再有这种感觉了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:46.48,EN,,0,0,0,,No, I think it's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:46.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,不 我觉得这是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.48,0:02:47.84,EN,,0,0,0,,been something that's been building
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.48,0:02:47.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,一件积累了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:54.00,EN,,0,0,0,,for a while and I've I just kind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,一段时间的事 我一直
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:54.96,EN,,0,0,0,,of keep pushing it off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:54.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,把它往后推
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and pushing it off just because that's how
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,一推再推
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:58.16,EN,,0,0,0,,the tennis world works
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为网球圈就是这样运转
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:03:01.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and it's just to the point
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:03:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在已经到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:04.24,EN,,0,0,0,,where I actually need to do something
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的得做点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:05.98,EN,,0,0,0,,about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:05.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,的时候了
